DESCRIPTION:Did you know your Chamber membership comes with an online busi
 ness listing? This free\, hands-on class will show you how to make the mos
 t of it! Learn how to enhance your Chamber page with updated copy\, photos
 \, videos\, and branding that helps drive more leads and visibility. Led b
 y markeing pro Gordon Coleman of GCJ Productions\, you'll walk away with a
  fully updated listing that works for your business- even when you're not 
 networking. Only for Wake Forest Chamber members Light breakfast snack inc
 luded Space is limited- bring your laptop or tablet Questions or need logi
 n help? Email Nancy.skelly@wakeforestchamber.org Let's turn your listing i
 nto a lead magnet!
