BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Become a Notary
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T053000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T130000
UID:d22844cffeb4c8dcf6ee72a0ec09bd77@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Become a Notary Public – Right Here at the Wake Forest Chamb
 er! Ready to boost your resume and serve your community? Wake Tech is brin
 ging its full-day Notary Public class to the Wake Forest Chamber – your 
 local hub for business resources and professional development. In this int
 eractive session\, you’ll cover the essentials: ✔️ What it means to 
 be a Notary Public ✔️ General powers\, oaths\, affidavits\, and certif
 ications ✔️ A final exam and help completing your official application
  Bonus: This instructor-led class moves at the pace of the group—so you 
 may finish early! 📘 The Notary Public Guidebook for North Carolina is i
 ncluded in the cost. 🍴 Lunch break? You're steps away from great spots 
 on White Street. 🪑 Plus\, the Chamber offers a comfortable\, profession
 al setting—no fluorescent-lit classrooms here. Open to both members and 
 non-members. Space is limited\, so register early! To qualify\, you must: 
 Be 18 or older Live or work in NC Be a legal U.S. resident Speak\, read\, 
 and write English
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/become-a-no
 tary-29149
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Heritage Business Alliance In-Person Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270125T050000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270125T060000
UID:1a2bdee2ec607371ae6e15ce9a1cfe4f@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:The Heritage Business Alliance (HBA) brings together businesse
 s located in and connected to the Heritage area of Wake Forest to strength
 en relationships\, share information\, and address the unique needs of thi
 s growing business community. HBA members meet quarterly in person to conn
 ect with one another\, discuss issues impacting Heritage businesses\, and 
 identify opportunities for collaboration\, advocacy\, and support. Meeting
 s also provide time to advance the Alliance's plan of work and ensure Heri
 tage businesses have a strong connection to the Wake Forest Area Chamber a
 nd community partners. Heritage-area businesses are encouraged to attend\,
  get involved\, and help shape the work of the Alliance.
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/heritage-bu
 siness-alliance-in-person-meeting
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
