DESCRIPTION:Have you joined the chamber in the last 6 months? This event i
 s created just for you! You're invited to come network with other new memb
 ers and our chamber ambassadors over breakfast. This event is hosted at th
 e chamber boardroom and is specifically reserved for new members only. Sto
 p by anytime between 8:00 am and 10:00 am to network with our community. P
 lease register the total amount of your party so we know how much food to 
