BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mastermind
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270106T050000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270106T050000
UID:c242fc9145d9d86a70fac15cf2274dfd@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Mastermind is back! We're excited to bring back one of our fav
 orite small business programs in partnership with Pinnacle Financial Partn
 ers. Think of Mastermind as a six-week\, low-commitment accelerator for yo
 ur business. A small\, focused group designed to help you step out of the 
 day-to-day and spend intentional time working ON your business. Using the 
 E-Myth Revisited by Michael Gerver as a guide\, participants will work thr
 ough practical conversations around building a stronger\, more productive 
 and sustainable business. The real value comes from the room: sharing idea
 s\, learning from other business owners\, challenging your own thinking an
 d leaving each week with something you can put to work. Mastermind is inte
 ntionally designed to be manageable. Give us one hour a week for six weeks
 \, come ready to particpate\, and put in a little work between sessions. P
 innacle will provide the structure\, conversation\, and accountability to 
 help you look at your business differently.
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/mastermind-
 29187
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
