UID:2a66c448ac3a4c7a8cb0ca4351bac815@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Have questions? Looking to get more involved? Let's connect! Y
 our Chamber membership opens the door to valuable resources\, relationship
 s\, and opportunities\, and we're here to help you make the most of it! Jo
 in us for Member Connect\, a casual\, welcoming opportunity to meet one-on
 -one with our Chamber team. Whether you're a new member\, a longtime suppo
 rter\, or simply have a question\, we'd love to connect! Let's talk about:
  Membership benefits and resources ChamberMaster and your member portal Sp
 onsorship and marketing opportunities Upcoming events and networking Commi
 ttees\, volunteering\, and getting involved Your ideas\, questions\, or fe
 edback No formal agenda. Just meaningful conversations focused on you and 
 your business. When: Second Friday of each month | 10:00–11:00 a.m.
